    "reading_order": 9,
    "text": "You will at once say that they are the photographs of the same monument\n(Taj Mahal) but are in different sizes. Would you say that the three photographs  are\nsimilar? Yes,they are.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
